Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/devclinton/putio-sync
Description: CLI tool for syncing files from Put.io to local storage
 putio-sync is a command-line tool for downloading and managing
 files from Put.io cloud storage service.
 .
 Features include:
  * Download files and folders from Put.io with concurrent workers
  * Resume support for interrupted downloads
  * Daemon mode for continuous syncing
  * Filter files by name, type, size, and date
  * Delete files after download
  * HTTP API server for remote control
  * Watch mode for automatic torrent uploads
  * Comprehensive download history and statistics
